      "runIndex": 0,
      "notes": [
        "Each day, the player could complete up to 5 Duel Meters, each of which required a different amount of points to sequentially complete. If a Duel Meter was completed, the appropriate reward was deposited in the player's Gift Box, and any excess points were transferred to the next Duel Meter (if applicable). When a new day began - which it did at 13:00 (EST) each day - any points leftover from an uncompleted Duel Meter would be deposited as an equal amount of Gold in the player's Gift Box, and the player could no longer earn points for the previous day's Duel Meters."
      ],
